  "posts": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Day 1 in Paris – Arrival and First Impressions",
      "body": "We arrived at Charles de Gaulle airport after a long flight. The city is absolutely stunning. Checked into our cozy hotel near the Marais district. Walked along the Seine and had our first croissant – magnifique!"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Day 2 – The Eiffel Tower Experience",
      "body": "Woke up early to beat the crowds at the Eiffel Tower. The view from the top is breathtaking. Had lunch at a small bistro nearby. In the evening we took a river cruise along the Seine."
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Day 3 – Louvre Museum Marathon",
      "body": "Spent the entire day at the Louvre. You could spend a week here and not see everything. The Mona Lisa was smaller than expected but the rest of the collection is extraordinary."
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Rome Day 1 – Eternal City Awaits",
      "body": "Arrived in Rome by train from Paris. The Colosseum at sunset is something I will never forget. Had the best carbonara of my life at a tiny restaurant near Trastevere."
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Rome Day 2 – Vatican and Sistine Chapel",
      "body": "Visited the Vatican Museums and the Sistine Chapel. Michelangelo's ceiling is absolutely breathtaking. Tossed a coin in the Trevi Fountain – we're definitely coming back!"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "userId": 2,
      "title": "Tokyo Day 1 – Shibuya Chaos",
      "body": "Landed in Narita and took the Narita Express to the city. Shibuya crossing at rush hour is organized chaos. Tried ramen for the first time – absolutely incredible."
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "userId": 2,
      "title": "Tokyo Day 2 – Temples and Shrines",
      "body": "Visited Senso-ji temple in Asakusa in the morning. The contrast between ancient temples and modern skyscrapers is fascinating. Had matcha everything today."
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "userId": 3,
      "title": "Barcelona Day 1 – Gaudi Magic",
      "body": "Sagrada Familia is unlike anything I have ever seen. Gaudi's architecture is otherworldly. The Barceloneta beach in the evening was perfect."
    },
    {
      "userId": "lf1H09F7Q-c",
      "title": "יום מספר 1: נוחתים בפריז",
      "body": "הגענו למלון, פרקנו מזוודות וישר יצאנו להסתובב. עברנו בין פטיסריז מדהימים ועד לחנויות בוטיק לעיצוב הבית. אספתי המון רעיונות חדשים לסידור הדירה וקניתי חומרי גלם מעולים.\"",
      "id": "BagWi-zwqP0"
    },
